1
00:00:00,946 --> 00:00:02,656
(Leonard:)Hold on.

2
00:00:03,031 --> 00:00:05,371
(Leonard:)What happened with you and Lalita?

3
00:00:05,534 --> 00:00:09,124
(Sheldon:)We ate, she lectured me on the link
between gum disease and heart attacks...

4
00:00:09,287 --> 00:00:12,207
(Sheldon:)...nothing I didn't already know,
and I came home.

5
00:00:12,791 --> 00:00:14,961
So you're not gonna see her again?

6
00:00:15,127 --> 00:00:16,757
(Sheldon:)Why would I see her again?

7
00:00:16,920 --> 00:00:19,380
(Sheldon:)I already have a dentist.

8
00:00:24,219 --> 00:00:28,099
I wonder who's gonna tell his parents
that they're not having grandchildren.

9
00:00:31,726 --> 00:00:32,976
[SINGING AND PLAYING "TO LIFE"]

10
00:00:33,145 --> 00:00:35,225
To life, to life, l'chaim

11
00:00:35,397 --> 00:00:37,687
L'chaim, l'chaim, to life

12
00:00:38,233 --> 00:00:40,273
Life has a way of amusing us

13
00:00:40,443 --> 00:00:42,113
Blessing and bruising us

14
00:00:42,279 --> 00:00:47,159
Drink l'chaim, to life

15
00:00:49,286 --> 00:00:51,576
(Raj:)I don't believe it.
What's gotten into him?

16
00:00:51,746 --> 00:00:56,746
(Penny:)Oh, maybe a couple of virgin Cuba Libres
that turned out to be kind of slutty.

17
00:00:57,919 --> 00:00:58,919
[CHUCKLES]
You didn't.

18
00:00:59,087 --> 00:01:01,337
(Penny:)Hey, you do your experiments, I do mine.

19
00:01:01,756 --> 00:01:04,796
(Sheldon:)To life

20
00:01:05,510 --> 00:01:08,720
[VOCALIZING]

